Each BRB publication ("tx") is headlined by a SHA256 hash.
This hash serves as a puzzle for readers.
The first person to solve the riddle of tx puzzle and report its message via SHA256sum and posted to BRB's X profile, https://x.com/BitcoinBooksRev, wins a block
Prizes may include Bitcoin books, BitAxes, and other Bitcoin items.
See each specific publication (tx) in the BRB_Review tag for prize info.

Have fun :)
